    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/2c1941c104a54a8d3082cdf4ea3335a2.poster.avif?t=1726896806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/2c1941c104a54a8d3082cdf4ea3335a2.webm?t=1726896806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/2c1941c104a54a8d3082cdf4ea3335a2.mp4?t=1726896806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/1a5dc13499de2c6f7d45ef492fc748ec.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=73 /></span>As the new academic year begins, you find yourself moving in with Hana, a close family friend, to attend university nearby. At first, it seems like there is no one you know, but soon enough, you discover that Mitsuki and Ayako, also your mother's close friends, are professors on campus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will they meet you? What will they teach you? What does your new best friend Yamada do with Mitsuki after classes, and will he handle it, or does he need some help? And what\u2019s the story with these beautiful, mature women, all of whom are unmarried? Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study hard and find the answers in Family Friends: Beyond Home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/d029f3506cd70668635c88748983787d.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/e0c276fb8d2f21110a6acceaadb80652.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/fe5f7c16d009e99140426953bbd118f6.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/3115acde0ab49a081d52a7004c2464b2.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=283 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/1ad5fb8eeccb2b9c195c0ac791e85b0b.avif?t=1726896806\" width=768 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/6b9ac5bbd8ac7fe4961b4c1b5bedaf86.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Earn points in 4 mini-games </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Watch over 800+ manga-style images in 24 cut-scenes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open 36 h-animations in pixel-art isometric style, featuring 12 unique poses.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/2c1941c104a54a8d3082cdf4ea3335a2.poster.avif?t=1726896806\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/2c1941c104a54a8d3082cdf4ea3335a2.webm?t=1726896806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/2c1941c104a54a8d3082cdf4ea3335a2.mp4?t=1726896806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/1a5dc13499de2c6f7d45ef492fc748ec.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=73 /></span>As the new academic year begins, you find yourself moving in with Hana, a close family friend, to attend university nearby. At first, it seems like there is no one you know, but soon enough, you discover that Mitsuki and Ayako, also your mother's close friends, are professors on campus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will they meet you? What will they teach you? What does your new best friend Yamada do with Mitsuki after classes, and will he handle it, or does he need some help? And what\u2019s the story with these beautiful, mature women, all of whom are unmarried? Why? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study hard and find the answers in Family Friends: Beyond Home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/d029f3506cd70668635c88748983787d.avif?t=1726896806\" width=620 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096340/extras/e0c276fb8d2f21110